### Admin – variabili
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@courseId = YOUR_COURSE_UUID_HERE

# ─── GET /admin/users ────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Lista tutti gli utenti (nessun filtro)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lista utenti filtrati per ruolo
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin?role=STUDENT
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lista utenti filtrati per stato
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin?is_active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lista utenti con entrambi i filtri
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin?role=INSTRUCTOR&is_active=false
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ─── PATCH /admin/courses/:id/approve ────────────────────────────────

### Approva un corso in PENDING
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses/{{courseId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approva un corso già PUBLISHED (atteso 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses/{{courseId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ─── PATCH /admin/courses/:id/reject ─────────────────────────────────

### Rifiuta un corso in PENDING
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses/{{courseId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Rifiuta un corso in DRAFT (atteso 403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses/{{courseId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ─── GET /admin/stats ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Statistiche globali
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}